<title>UK: BGL sets 2.0 bln Lux franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>BGL sets 2.0 bln Lux franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following self-led subordinated bond was announced by lead manager Banque Generale du Luxembourg SA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE GENERALE DU LUXEMBOURG SA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    22.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE    22.AUG.97</p>
<p> YIELD	5.73	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
